<title>POLAND: ESPEBEPE 96 LOSS RISES TO PLN 51.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>ESPEBEPE 96 LOSS RISES TO PLN 51.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		30.95 vs  18.89</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	  30.95 vs  18.85</p>
<p> Operating loss	11.48 vs  18.51</p>
<p> Sales		   11.31 vs   9.12</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		51.50 vs  17.85</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	  51.49 vs  17.85</p>
<p> Operating loss	22.07 vs  14.65</p>
<p> Sales		  117.25 vs 114.69</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is Espebepe</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>The company said that reserves for liabilities, losses from</p>
<p>bad contracts and pending settlement with creditors affected</p>
<p>its December results.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
